#### f3-1: LDP の疑似回線(VLAN 130・pw-id 130)XE1⇔XE3 を EVC E130 で作り、両端に up MEP(41/43)
configure terminal
Enter configuration commands, one per line.  End with CNTL/Z.
CE1(config)#
interface Ethernet0/0.130
CE1(config-subif)#
encapsulation dot1Q 130
CE1(config-subif)#
ip address 192.168.130.1 255.255.255.0
CE1(config-subif)#
end
CE1#
configure terminal
Enter configuration commands, one per line.  End with CNTL/Z.
CE3(config)#
interface Ethernet0/0.130
CE3(config-subif)#
encapsulation dot1Q 130
CE3(config-subif)#
ip address 192.168.130.3 255.255.255.0
CE3(config-subif)#
end
CE3#
configure terminal
Enter configuration commands, one per line.  End with CNTL/Z.
XE1(config)#
ethernet evc E130
XE1(config-evc)#
exit
XE1(config)#
ethernet cfm domain CUST level 5
XE1(config-ecfm)#
service E-LINE-130 evc E130
XE1(config-ecfm-srv)#
continuity-check
XE1(config-ecfm-srv)#
continuity-check interval 1s
XE1(config-ecfm-srv)#
exit
XE1(config-ecfm)#
exit
XE1(config)#
interface GigabitEthernet2
XE1(config-if)#
service instance 130 ethernet E130
XE1(config-if-srv)#
encapsulation dot1q 130
XE1(config-if-srv)#
rewrite ingress tag pop 1 symmetric
XE1(config-if-srv)#
cfm mep domain CUST mpid 41
XE1(config-if-srv-ecfm-mep)#
exit
XE1(config-if-srv)#
exit
XE1(config-if)#
l2vpn xconnect context E130
XE1(config-xconnect)#
member GigabitEthernet2 service-instance 130
XE1(config-xconnect)#
member 10.255.0.43 130 encapsulation mpls
XE1(config-xconnect)#
end
XE1#
configure terminal
Enter configuration commands, one per line.  End with CNTL/Z.
XE3(config)#
ethernet evc E130
XE3(config-evc)#
exit
XE3(config)#
ethernet cfm domain CUST level 5
XE3(config-ecfm)#
service E-LINE-130 evc E130
XE3(config-ecfm-srv)#
continuity-check
XE3(config-ecfm-srv)#
continuity-check interval 1s
XE3(config-ecfm-srv)#
exit
XE3(config-ecfm)#
exit
XE3(config)#
interface GigabitEthernet2
XE3(config-if)#
service instance 130 ethernet E130
XE3(config-if-srv)#
encapsulation dot1q 130
XE3(config-if-srv)#
rewrite ingress tag pop 1 symmetric
XE3(config-if-srv)#
cfm mep domain CUST mpid 43
XE3(config-if-srv-ecfm-mep)#
exit
XE3(config-if-srv)#
exit
XE3(config-if)#
l2vpn xconnect context E130
XE3(config-xconnect)#
member GigabitEthernet2 service-instance 130
XE3(config-xconnect)#
member 10.255.0.41 130 encapsulation mpls
XE3(config-xconnect)#
end
